OL,3,GNEWSABridge to close to public for
OL,4,A#6.2m reconstruction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic bridge will close to the
OL,7,Fpublic next month as work begins on its
OL,8,Ffull reconstruction.
OL,10,FThe #6.2m project, which will replace
OL,11,FCastle Cornet bridge's 95m (312ft)
OL,12,Fconcrete deck and single-span approach
OL,13,Fbridge, is expected to last eight
OL,14,Fmonths.
OL,16,FCastle Cornet will remain open until 6
OL,17,FSeptember before an extended winter
OL,18,Fclosure while the reconstruction takes
OL,19,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
