OL,3,GNEWSABridge to close to public for
OL,4,A#6.2m reconstruction
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom 7 September, the bridge, adjacent
OL,7,Fparking area and raised walkway will be
OL,8,Fclosed to the public. The new bridge is
OL,9,Fexpected to reopen in late May 2027.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
